cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use osmotool, please cite it as below, together with the DOI of the
  osmo_refdb release you ran it with.
title: osmotool
abstract: >-
  Screen osmoadaptation genes in metagenomic reads and assembled genomes:
  reads are assigned against an annotated gene catalog first, with
  translated search (DIAMOND + HMMER) for the rest.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Verhaar
    given-names: Barbara
repository-code: "https://github.com/barbarahelena/osmotool"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - metagenomics
  - osmoadaptation
  - DIAMOND
  - HMMER
  - gene catalog
# version, date-released and doi: fill in at the v0.10.0 tag / Zenodo upload
